{"id": "55541", "title": "破", "author": "妖蓝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/55/55541.htm", "intro": "初秋，树叶渐黄，阴冷的风吹着，一个少女静立于墓园里，风打散她披散的秀发，露出她的面容，那是怎样的一张绝色的脸啊：黑发如泉，肤色胜雪，榴齿含香，朱唇若火。少女一袭白衣，乍放于风中，飘飘似仙子，她将手中一大束花放在墓前，低声道：“妈妈，若柔来看你了。我会按您的嘱咐去做的，您放心吧。”淡淡的哀愁染上绝世的容颜，少女静立良久，转身离去。", "base": "files/article/html/55/55541", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "7683573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章初露锋芒", "file": "7683576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章课外辅导", "file": "7683577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章再次相遇", "file": "7683578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章拔刀相助", "file": "7683579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章交手", "file": "7683581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章比试（一）", "file": "7683583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章比试（二）", "file": "7683584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章被擒", "file": "7683586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章惩罚（一）", "file": "7683592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "7683595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "7683597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "7683600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "7683603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "7683605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "7683609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "7683611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "7683613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-96", "file": "7683619.html", "available": false}]}